(Sidney Cox/The Sidney Lawrence Company,BMI)

Performed by Alison Krauss & Union Station on "I've Got That Old Feeling".
Tabbed by Tim Wilson

-----------------------------------------------------

This song is interesting, I think, because of the decending chromatic bass line
in the verse, and the rather unusual IV to IVm change that goes with it.

The song is actually in E; here are the chords & bass notes in E:

